// EVOSAVE - store the workspace ([I]/[J], M x N, flag V) into slot Z (1=A 2=B 3=R 4=step start).
// Slot lists hold {rows, cols, approx, n11, d11, n12, d12, ...} with room for 72 cells.
// Clobbers: I J K, ʟMXW
{M,N,V}→ʟMXW
147→dim(ʟMXW)
4→K
For(I,1,M)
For(J,1,N)
[I](I,J)→ʟMXW(K):[J](I,J)→ʟMXW(K+1)
K+2→K
End
End
If Z=1:ʟMXW→ʟMXA
If Z=2:ʟMXW→ʟMXB
If Z=3:ʟMXW→ʟMXR
If Z=4:ʟMXW→ʟMXST
